-- German translations for the 20 vaccination catalog items introduced by the BAG
-- Impfplan reconciliation. Unlike the EviPrev German pass, this is not a back-
-- translation of the English base columns -- both the English content and this German
-- content trace back independently to the same source, "Schweizerischer Impfplan 2026"
-- (BAG/EKIF, Stand Februar 2026), which is itself entirely in German. The English
-- columns on preventive_catalog_items remain the required base/default-locale content
-- (DEFAULT_CATALOG_LOCALE = 'en' in supabasePreventiveCatalog.js, matching the existing
-- EviPrev precedent); this table is what lets German-locale users see the app in the
-- source document's own language instead of falling back to the English paraphrase.

on conflict (item_id, locale) do update set
  name = excluded.name,
  cadence_label = excluded.cadence_label,
  why_it_matters = excluded.why_it_matters,
  recommendation_text = excluded.recommendation_text,
  updated_at = now();
